 "premise": "Ardis (also romanized Aldis) uses a new 'sword sorcery' that sends blades flying through the air, and works as a mercenary paid to kill, escort or investigate. Returning from a job, he protects twin girls who survived a bandit attack on their caravan, but in this world twins are considered abominations because of a goddess's intervention. With the twins and a girl who follows him as his servant, he travels on, holding back his anger at the world's cold treatment of them. Adapted from a light novel.",
 "life_message": "Protecting those a society rejects matters more than that society's prejudices, even ones claimed to come from a goddess.",
